        "body": "#### Pull Request\r\n- #612\r\n\r\n#### Main additions\r\n\r\n- #608\r\n- #609\r\n- GUI additions for monitoring selected SNPs\r\n- Haplotype : toggle features of each viewed Block \r\n\r\n#### Changes Implemented\r\n   * bf72b72b update version to 3.12.2\r\n* 124a8a59 toggle feature in each block instead of the first match\r\n* a55f24a3 move checkboxes related to Filter by defined Haplotype onto a separate row\r\n* d4ba3a64 show selected SNP count per-block\r\n* 0177eb08 when filtering by Haplotype, display samples count in Actions panel\r\n* 78ac9339 make referenceBlock sampleFilters display depend on options=devel\r\n* af4661ab Clear sampleFilters recorded in referenceBlock\r\n* a194fbda add generated test function for allowMissing.\r\n* fb34e424 add button Copy Haplotype\r\n* c6f1bb73 add allowMissing\r\n* 893c450d handle repeated calls - use promiseThrottle()\r\n* bba5c63a add renameChromosomes and splitIntoChromosomes\r\n* 270905d8 position tool-tip so it is readable\r\n* 69316c95 if not zoomed out and some existing <rect>s are opacity 0 then change them\r\n* 5aaee1b0 sampleFilters : avoid selected feature references crossing dataset boundary\r\n  ",
